  "solution": "The pattern followed here is:\n\nWe have to interchange the signs in the given equations to make it correct.\n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) - and +\n\n**Given: **120 + 18 × 40 – 10 ÷ 20 = 172\n\nAfter interchanging the sign we get the;\n\n⇒ 120 - 18 × 40 + __**10 ÷ 20**__ = 172\n\n⇒ 120 - __**18 × 40**__ + 0.5 = 172\n\n⇒ __**120**__ - 720 __**+ 0.5**__ = 172\n\n⇒ __**120.5 - 720**__ = 172\n\n⇒ - 599.5 ≠ 720\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) + and × \n\nGiven: 120 + 18 × 40 – 10 ÷ 20 = 172\n\nAfter interchanging the sign we get the;\n\n⇒ 120 × 18 + 40 – __**10 ÷ 20**__ = 172\n\n⇒ **__120 × 18__ **+ 40 – 0.5 = 172\n\n⇒ __**2160 + 40**__ - 0.5 = 172\n\n⇒ __**2200 - 0.5 **__= 172\n\n⇒ 2199.5 ≠ 172\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) + and ÷\n\nGiven: 120 + 18 × 40 – 10 ÷ 20 = 172\n\nAfter interchanging the sign we get the;\n\n⇒ __**120 ÷ 18** __× 40 – 10 + 20 = 172\n\n⇒**__ 6.66 × 40__** – 10 + 20 = 172\n\n⇒ __**266.66**__ - 10 __**+ 20 **__= 172\n\n⇒ 286.66 - 10 = 172\n\n⇒ 276.6 ≠ 172\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) ÷ and – \n\nGiven: 120 + 18 × 40 – 10 ÷ 20 = 172\n\nAfter interchanging the sign we get the;\n\n⇒ 120 + 18 × __**40 ÷ 10**__ - 20 = 172\n\n⇒ 120 + __**18 × 4**__ - 20 = 172\n\n⇒ __**120 + 72**__ - 20 = 172\n\n⇒ __**192 - 20**__ = 172\n\n⇒ 172 = 172\n\n⇒ LHS = RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 4\".",
